    "en": {
      "title": "Automated grout plants (FAIC)",
      "h1": "Automated grout plants (FAIC)",
      "description": "Automated plants for preparing and injecting cement, bentonite, microfine binders and mortar. Accurate dosing, consumption record, integrated pressure and flow recording and radio remote control.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Häny: Fully automatic pumps (FAIC)",
          "width": 876,
          "height": 510,
          "src": "/assets/img/haeny-automatiska-pumpar-1.webp",
          "href": "/produkter/haeny"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Häny: Fully automatic pumps (FAIC), image 2",
          "width": 733,
          "height": 827,
          "src": "/assets/img/haeny-automatiska-pumpar-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Häny FAIC"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Compact, automated grouting plant combining mixer, agitator and grout pump. It offers high production capacity, quality assurance and cost savings through automated operation. It handles materials with a high sand content and low water/cement ratios (w/c) and is suitable for a range of grouting applications such as rock anchoring, sealing and microtunnelling."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Overview",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Extremely compact mixing and injection system with central lifting point for easy transport and minimum installation time",
            "High production output, quality monitoring and cost savings in terms of personnel costs due to fully automated mixing process",
            "Precise dosing of individual components is guaranteed by a sophisticated weighing system in the mixer (typical feed of dry components via silos/screw)",
            "Mixing recipes can be entered and selected via touch screen as required",
            "Batch records of each mixing cycle with consumption records (total of consumed components) is stored and can be transferred via a USB interface"
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
